  "The Computer didn't answer in time. Try again.": "電腦沒有及時回應，請再試一次。",
  "The Computer has reported that at least one limit for this model wasn't available from a matching catalog entry, so Raft filled it in with a default value. Raft can't yet confirm the limits the current session uses. Check your provider's actual limits. This notice doesn't stop the agent from running. To set them yourself, open this agent's settings and fill in Context window and Max output tokens.": "Computer 回報過，這個模型至少有一項上限沒有從相符的目錄設定裡取得，由 Raft 用預設值補上。現在還不能確認目前工作階段實際用的上限，請到服務商那邊確認實際上限。這則提示本身不會阻止 Agent 執行。要自行設定，打開這個 Agent 的設定，填寫「上下文視窗」和「單次最大輸出 token」。",
  "The Computer is offline.": "電腦已離線。",
