  "The Terms of Service or Privacy Policy changed. Review and continue.": "服務條款或隱私權政策已更新，請檢閱後繼續。",
  "The Windows version is coming soon. Until then, use Raft in your browser.": "Windows 版即將推出。在那之前，請先透過瀏覽器使用 Raft。",
  "The access is server-wide: {agent} can search and read other agents' context on this whole server, limited to messages {agent} can see. Whoever controls {agent} can read what it reads: its creator, who may be an ordinary member, and anyone on its Computer.": "此存取權涵蓋整個伺服器：{agent} 可以搜尋和讀取此伺服器上其他 Agent 的上下文，但僅限 {agent} 自己看得到的訊息。能控制 {agent} 的人都能讀到它讀到的內容：包括它的建立者（可能只是一般成員），以及能使用它所在電腦的任何人。",
  "The action was not carried out.": "此操作未執行。",
  "The address of your server's OpenAI-compatible API.": "你的伺服器的 OpenAI 相容 API 位址。",
  "The agent already moved to the cloud, so this migration can no longer be canceled.": "Agent 已遷移到雲端，因此無法再取消這次遷移。",
  "The agent could not reach its model provider, or the request timed out. Try again later; if it keeps happening, ask the agent's owner to check the computer's network.": "Agent 無法連線到它的模型服務商，或請求逾時。請稍後再試；如果持續發生，請 Agent 的擁有者檢查電腦的網路。",
  "The agent could not reach its model provider, or the request timed out. Try again later; if it keeps happening, check the network on the agent's computer.": "Agent 無法連線到它的模型服務商，或請求逾時。請稍後再試；如果持續發生，請檢查 Agent 所在電腦的網路。",
  "The agent did not finish within 30 minutes. This is a failed run, not a finding of no problems. The service will try a new run.": "Agent 未在 30 分鐘內完成。這是一次失敗的執行，並不代表沒有問題；服務會重新執行一輪。",
  "The agent exists, but no usable token was received. A token may have been created if the response was lost. Check existing credentials before generating another.": "Agent 已存在，但未收到可用的 Token。如果回應遺失，Token 可能已經建立。再次產生前，請先檢查現有的憑證。",
  "The agent had already switched to the new computer. Raft is stopping it there and cleaning up both computers.": "Agent 已切換到新電腦。Raft 正在新電腦上停止 Agent，並清理兩台電腦。",
  "The agent hasn't switched computers yet, so it stays on the original computer. Raft is cleaning up.": "Agent 尚未切換到新電腦，因此會繼續留在原電腦上。Raft 正在進行清理。",
  "The agent hasn't switched to the cloud, so it stays on {source}. Raft is cleaning up.": "Agent 還沒切換到雲端，因此仍在 {source} 上。Raft 正在進行清理。",
  "The agent is already in the cloud.": "Agent 已經在雲端。",
  "The agent is still on {source} and works as usual.": "Agent 仍在 {source} 上，可照常使用。",
  "The agent migrated to {target} and is now running there.": "Agent 已遷移到 {target}，並已在那裡執行。",
  "The agent moved to {target} but could not start there. Make sure Raft Computer is running on {target}, then start the agent.": "Agent 已遷移到 {target}，但無法在那裡啟動。請確認 {target} 上的 Raft Computer 正在執行，然後啟動 Agent。",
  "The agent now has a GitHub connection you did not start. If you did not expect it, open the agent and disconnect it.": "此 Agent 現在有一個不是由你發起的 GitHub 連結。如果這不在你的預期中，請開啟該 Agent 並中斷連結。",
  "The agent now runs in the cloud.": "Agent 現在在雲端執行。",
  "The agent stops and no longer counts toward your plan's agent limit. Its profile and message history stay visible, read-only.": "Agent 會停止執行，且不再佔用方案的 Agent 名額。它的個人檔案和訊息記錄仍可以唯讀方式查看。",
  "The agent stops on {source} while the cloud checks its files and you review what moves.": "在雲端檢查檔案、你確認要遷移的內容期間，{source} 上的 Agent 會停止執行。",
  "The agent switched to the cloud but did not finish setting up there. If you contact support, include the migration ID.": "Agent 已切換到雲端，但未能在雲端完成設定。如需聯絡支援團隊，請提供遷移編號。",
  "The agent uses the chosen model from its next turn; it does not restart.": "Agent 會從下一輪開始使用所選的模型，不會重新啟動。",
  "The agent was deleted in the cloud, and the cloud can't set it up again for this agent. The Raft team has been alerted. If you contact support, include the migration ID.": "這個 Agent 已在雲端遭到刪除，雲端無法再為它重新設定。Raft 團隊已收到通知。如需聯絡支援團隊，請提供遷移編號。",
  "The agent's MEMORY.md can't be brought to the cloud: it is too large, is not plain text, or the cloud refused it. Ask the agent to trim MEMORY.md to plain text, then try again.": "Agent 的 MEMORY.md 無法遷移到雲端：檔案太大、不是純文字，或遭雲端拒絕。請讓 Agent 將 MEMORY.md 精簡為純文字，然後再試一次。",
  "The agent's computer was asked for its session record. Whether one was attached shows here if it answers.": "已向 Agent 所在的電腦要求工作階段記錄。它回覆後，這裡會顯示是否已附上。",
  "The agent's configured model is not available to its provider account. Ask the agent's owner to choose another model or change the plan.": "Agent 的服務商帳號無法使用它設定的模型。請 Agent 的擁有者選擇其他模型，或變更方案。",
  "The agent's input is larger than its model accepts. Ask the agent's owner to reset the session or reduce the startup context.": "Agent 的輸入超出模型可接受的大小。請 Agent 的擁有者重設工作階段，或縮減啟動上下文。",
  "The agent's input is larger than its model accepts. Reset the session, or reduce the startup context.": "Agent 的輸入超出模型可接受的大小。請重設工作階段，或縮減啟動上下文。",
  "The agent's model is not available to its provider account. Choose another model in the agent's settings, or change the plan.": "Agent 的服務商帳號無法使用它的模型。請在 Agent 的設定中選擇其他模型，或變更方案。",
  "The agent's model provider billing or credit balance is exhausted. Ask the agent's owner to add credits or switch it to another model or provider.": "Agent 的模型服務商帳戶餘額或額度已用完。請 Agent 的擁有者加值，或將它改用其他模型或服務商。",
  "The agent's model provider usage limit has been reached. Wait for the limit to reset, or ask the agent's owner to switch it to another model or account.": "Agent 的模型服務商已達用量上限。請等待額度重設，或請 Agent 的擁有者將它改用其他模型或帳號。",
  "The agent's provider refused this GitHub request. Try again; if it keeps happening, copy the details for whoever manages the agent's provider.": "Agent 的供應商拒絕了這次 GitHub 請求。請再試一次；如果持續發生，請複製詳細資料，交給負責此 Agent 供應商的人。",
  "The agent's runtime is not signed in, or its provider credential was rejected. Ask the agent's owner to sign in again or update the credential.": "Agent 的執行環境尚未登入，或服務商憑證遭拒。請 Agent 的擁有者重新登入或更新憑證。",
  "The agent's runtime is not signed in, or its provider credential was rejected. Sign in again on the agent's computer, or update the credential.": "Agent 的執行環境尚未登入，或服務商憑證遭拒。請在 Agent 所在的電腦上重新登入，或更新憑證。",
  "The agent's source computer is unavailable. Reconnect it and try again.": "這個 Agent 的來源電腦目前無法使用。請讓它重新連線後再試一次。",
  "The agreement was updated. Open the join action again to review the latest version.": "協議已更新。請重新點選加入，以檢視最新版本。",
  "The analysis agent could not start. An administrator needs to check the cloud agent service.": "分析 Agent 無法啟動，需要管理員檢查雲端 Agent 服務。",
  "The app couldn't prepare this action. Try again.": "應用程式無法準備此操作，請再試一次。",
  "The app will be signed in as ": "App 將以此帳號登入：",
  "The app you are continuing to with Login with Raft.": "你將透過「使用 Raft 登入」前往的應用程式。",
  "The attachment could not be opened. Try again.": "無法開啟附件，請再試一次。",
  "The attachment exceeds the plan limit.": "附件超過方案限制。",
  "The attachment is empty.": "附件是空的。",
  "The bridge credential was revoked.": "橋接憑證已被撤銷。",
  "The browser rejected the clipboard copy command": "瀏覽器拒絕了剪貼簿複製指令",
  "The bundle includes the issue description plus the client-side context you selected.": "資料包內含問題描述，以及你勾選附上的相關內容。",
  "The channel audience could not be read.": "無法讀取頻道受眾。",
  "The channel may be briefly read-only while conversion finishes.": "轉換完成前，頻道可能會短暫變為唯讀。",
  "The channel name or description has unsaved edits. Save them before closing?": "頻道名稱或說明有未儲存的變更。要在關閉前儲存嗎？",
  "The channel was saved, but its Slack bridge was not enabled. Retry to finish the bridge setup.": "頻道已儲存，但未啟用 Slack 橋接。請重試以完成橋接設定。",
  "The cloud agent needs attention": "雲端 Agent 需要處理",
  "The cloud couldn't import the workspace files. This can still finish, and the Raft team has been alerted. If you contact support, include the migration ID.": "雲端無法匯入工作區檔案。遷移仍可能完成，Raft 團隊已收到通知。如需聯絡支援團隊，請提供遷移編號。",
  "The cloud couldn't set up the agent. This can still finish, and the Raft team has been alerted. If you contact support, include the migration ID.": "雲端無法設定這個 Agent。遷移仍可能完成，Raft 團隊已收到通知。如需聯絡支援團隊，請提供遷移編號。",
  "The cloud found this agent under a different account than Raft expected, a configuration problem on Raft's side. The Raft team has been alerted. If you contact support, include the migration ID.": "雲端找到的這個 Agent 屬於與 Raft 預期不同的帳號，這是 Raft 端的設定問題。Raft 團隊已收到通知。如需聯絡支援團隊，請提供遷移編號。",
  "The cloud never set the agent up, so Raft put it back on {source} unchanged. You can try again.": "雲端始終沒有完成這個 Agent 的設定，因此 Raft 已將它原封不動地放回 {source}。你可以再試一次。",
  "The cloud still hasn't imported the workspace files, long after the switch. This can still finish, and the Raft team has been alerted. If you contact support, include the migration ID.": "切換到雲端已過了很久，雲端仍未匯入工作區檔案。遷移仍可能完成，Raft 團隊已收到通知。如需聯絡支援團隊，請提供遷移編號。",
  "The code expires in {minutes, plural, one {# minute} other {# minutes}}.": "驗證碼將在 {minutes} 分鐘後失效。",
  "The comment is deleted for everyone.": "刪除後，所有人都看不到這則留言。",
  "The comment this draft replies to was deleted. Delete the draft.": "這則草稿回覆的留言已經被刪除了，刪除這則。",
  "The computer host isn't available in this build.": "此版本無法在本機執行電腦服務。",
  "The connection between the two computers dropped at {time}, during the transfer.": "兩台電腦之間的連線在 {time} 中斷，當時正在傳輸。",
  "The connection between the two computers dropped during the transfer. Make sure both computers are online, then try again.": "傳輸過程中，兩台電腦之間的連線中斷了。請確認兩台電腦都已上線，然後再試一次。",
  "The connection between the two computers dropped during the transfer.": "傳輸過程中，兩台電腦之間的連線中斷了。",
  "The connection is not ready for this change. Refresh its status and try again.": "連線目前無法進行此變更，請重新整理狀態後再試。",
  "The connection stays, but its sign-in is removed. Agents pinned to this connection are refused until someone signs in again with Reauthorize.": "連線會保留，但登入狀態會被移除。固定使用這個連線的 Agent 會被拒絕，直到有人透過「重新授權」再次登入。",
  "The context is too large and shrinking it automatically didn't fix it. Reset the session and restart; if one message is itself very large, switch to a model with a larger context or split the content.": "上下文太大，自動縮減沒能解決。可以重設工作階段後重新啟動；如果某則訊息本身很大，換一個上下文更大的模型，或把內容拆小。",
  "The current bridge state has not been verified.": "目前的橋接狀態尚未驗證。",
  "The current deletion request could not be confirmed. Load it again before cancelling.": "無法確認目前的刪除請求，請重新載入後再撤銷。",
  "The current session context isn't carried over: the agent starts a new session in the cloud.": "目前工作階段的上下文不會一併遷移，Agent 會在雲端開始新的工作階段。",
  "The current signing secret will stop working immediately, so your app must switch to the new one to keep verifying events. The new secret is shown once after rotating.": "目前的簽章密鑰將立即失效，你的 App 需要改用新密鑰才能繼續驗證事件。輪替後，新密鑰只會顯示一次。",
  "The developer changed the text this app adds to agent prompts. Approved text goes live, then each Server's admins confirm it.": "開發人員變更了此應用程式加入 Agent 提示詞的文字。核准後新文字即會生效，再由各伺服器的管理員確認。",
  "The developer sees this.": "開發人員會看到這段說明。",
  "The diagnostic log could not be uploaded. Your feedback will be submitted without it.": "無法上傳診斷記錄，意見回饋將不附記錄直接送出。",
  "The email wasn't sent. Try again.": "電子郵件未寄出，請再試一次。",
  "The file reached Raft, but saving it timed out.": "檔案已傳到 Raft，但儲存逾時。",
  "The file this draft is on isn't in the Artifact any more. Delete the draft.": "這則草稿所在的檔案已經不在 Artifact 裡了，刪除這則。",
  "The first line is the task's title; the rest is its description.": "第一行是任務標題，其餘是任務描述。",
  "The first message is older than {days} days": "第一則訊息已超過 {days} 天",
  "The hosted connection check failed.": "託管連線檢查失敗。",
  "The image came out empty. Try again, or select fewer messages.": "產生的圖片是空白的。請再試一次，或少選幾則訊息。",
  "The install is quarantined and needs operator review.": "此安裝已遭隔離，需要維運人員檢查。",
  "The install needs a new Slack authorization.": "此安裝需要重新進行 Slack 授權。",
  "The install, credential, bindings, and audience are verified.": "安裝、憑證、頻道對應和受眾皆已驗證。",
  "The installed OAuth scopes do not match the required grant.": "已安裝的 OAuth 權限範圍與所需授權不符。",
  "The installer can't upgrade this Computer while it runs inside your systemd unit {unit}. On that machine: stop the unit ({stopCommand}), run the install command below once, then start it again ({startCommand}).": "這台 Computer 執行在你的 systemd 單元 {unit} 裡時，安裝程式無法升級它。請在那台電腦上：先停止該單元（{stopCommand}），執行一次下面的安裝指令，再重新啟動它（{startCommand}）。",
  "The installer can't upgrade this Computer while it runs inside your systemd unit. Stop the unit, run the install command below once, then start it again.": "這台 Computer 執行在你的 systemd 單元裡時，安裝程式無法升級它。先停止該單元，執行一次下面的安裝指令，再重新啟動它。",
  "The invite link sent to {email} stops working. You can invite them again later.": "傳給 {email} 的邀請連結將會失效。之後你可以再次邀請對方。",
  "The invite link works for {days} days. People can join as a guest, or connect their server to bring in their agents and teammates.": "邀請連結在 {days} 天內有效。對方可以用訪客身分加入，或連結自己的伺服器，帶入他們的 Agent 和團隊成員。",
  "The invites were sent, but your servers weren't connected. Try connecting them again.": "邀請已傳送，但你的伺服器未能連結，請再試一次。",
  "The last delete did not go through. It is retried automatically.": "上一次刪除未成功，系統會自動重試。",
  "The last lines of this computer's log. They may include lines from other agents on it.": "記錄檔最後幾行，可能含這台電腦上其他 Agent 的內容。",
  "The last search request failed. Existing results are preserved when possible, but this query needs a retry.": "上次的搜尋請求失敗。已盡可能保留現有結果，但此查詢需要重試。",
  "The last upgrade got no response from the Computer. Run {command} on that machine to check.": "上次升級沒有收到電腦的回應。請在那台電腦上執行 {command} 檢查。",
  "The last workspace operation failed. Try again.": "上一次工作區操作失敗，請再試一次。",
  "The leading @ was removed automatically — it is display notation, not part of the name.": "開頭的 @ 已自動移除——那只是顯示用的符號，不屬於名稱的一部分。",
  "The link may be wrong, or you don't have access to it.": "連結可能有誤，或者你沒有權限查看。",
  "The link works for 30 minutes. The 72-hour wait starts when you open it.": "連結在 30 分鐘內有效。72 小時的等待期會從你開啟連結時開始計算。",
  "The local service isn't reachable.": "無法連線至本機服務。",
  "The message you're looking for is older than {days} days": "你要找的訊息已超過 {days} 天",
  "The migration changed before this action completed. Refresh and try again.": "此操作完成前，遷移狀態已有變更。請重新整理後再試一次。",
  "The migration changed concurrently. Refresh and try again.": "遷移狀態同時被其他操作更新。請重新整理後再試一次。",
  "The migration could not be started. Check both computers and try again.": "無法開始遷移。請檢查兩台電腦，然後再試一次。",
  "The migration moved on before your request went through. Check the latest status and try again.": "你的要求送出前，遷移已有新進度。請查看最新狀態後再試一次。",
  "The migration reference is missing or invalid. Refresh the migration status before trying again.": "遷移編號遺失或無效。請先重新整理遷移狀態，然後再試一次。",
  "The migration status is incomplete. Refresh before trying to cancel again.": "遷移狀態不完整。請重新整理後再嘗試取消。",
  "The migration stopped before it completed. Review the technical reason, then try again.": "遷移在完成前就停止了。請查看技術原因後再試一次。",
  "The migration was canceled after the agent switched computers. The agent is stopped on the new computer, and cleanup is done.": "遷移在 Agent 切換電腦後才取消。Agent 已在新電腦上停止，清理作業也已完成。",
  "The migration was canceled before the agent switched computers. The agent is still on the original computer.": "遷移在 Agent 切換電腦前就已取消。Agent 仍在原電腦上。",
  "The model could not be changed. Try again.": "無法變更模型，請再試一次。",
  "The model produced tool-call arguments in an invalid format, so Codex rejected the tool call — try a different model.": "模型產生的工具呼叫參數格式無效，因此 Codex 拒絕了這次工具呼叫——請改用其他模型。",
  "The model provider's billing or credit balance is exhausted. Add credits with the provider, or switch the agent to another model or provider in its settings.": "模型服務商的帳戶餘額或額度已用完。請向服務商加值，或在 Agent 的設定中將它改用其他模型或服務商。",
  "The model provider's usage limit has been reached. Wait for the limit to reset, or switch the agent to another model or account in its settings.": "模型服務商已達用量上限。請等待額度重設，或在 Agent 的設定中將它改用其他模型或帳號。",
  "The model settings could not be loaded. Try again later.": "無法載入模型設定，請稍後再試。",
  "The model's name as your provider spells it.": "服務商使用的模型名稱。",
  "The move to the cloud was canceled. The agent is still on {source}.": "遷移到雲端已取消，Agent 仍在 {source} 上。",
  "The name <mono>#{name}</mono> is held by an archived channel.": "名稱 <mono>#{name}</mono> 已被一個已封存的頻道使用。",
  "The number changed since you looked. Check the new one, then confirm again.": "人數在你查看之後有變化。請看看新的人數，再確認一次。",
  "The options could not be loaded.": "無法載入選項。",
  "The overview shows one line per finished turn. This agent hasn't reported a finished turn yet.": "概覽會為每個完成的輪次顯示一行。此 Agent 還沒有回報任何已完成的輪次。",
  "The owner wasn’t changed. Try again.": "擁有者沒有變更，請再試一次。",
  "The page reported an error in v{version} (viewer {width}px wide):\n{message}": "頁面在 v{version} 報錯（檢視器寬 {width}px）：\n{message}",
  "The plan and usage below may be out of date.": "下方的方案和用量可能不是最新的。",
  "The platform's daily limit has been reached. Cloud agents' model calls are refused until {time}.": "平台已達每日上限，雲端 Agent 的模型呼叫在 {time} 前都會被拒絕。",
  "The preview isn't available right now": "預覽暫時無法使用",
  "The provider connection could not be created.": "無法建立供應商連線。",
  "The provider connection could not be updated.": "無法更新供應商連線。",
  "The provider refused the model this agent was set to start on. Choose a model, then retry.": "供應商拒絕了這個 Agent 原本設定使用的模型。請選擇模型後再重試。",
  "The published Windows installer currently supports x64 only.": "目前發布的 Windows 安裝程式僅支援 x64。",
  "The reminder wasn't sent. Try again.": "提醒沒有發出去，請再試一次。",
  "The reply body is not retained after this page closes; the receipt above is the durable record.": "關閉此頁面後不會保留回覆內容；上方的驗證結果才是永久紀錄。",
  "The reply is in a conversation you can't see.": "這則回覆位於你無法查看的對話中。",
  "The reply you're looking for is older than {days} days": "你要找的回覆已超過 {days} 天",
  "The report was uploaded, but we couldn't open a feedback ticket for it. Share the reference below with the Raft team.": "回報已上傳，但無法為其建立意見回饋單。請將下方的參考資訊提供給 Raft 團隊。",
  "The request was canceled, and {requester} has been told.": "申請已取消，並已通知 {requester}。",
  "The requesting agent becomes this app's owner and can rotate, update, or transfer it after commit.": "發出要求的 Agent 會成為此應用程式的擁有者，提交後可以輪替、更新或轉移。",
  "The reset wasn't cancelled. Try again.": "無法取消重設，請再試一次。",
  "The rest happens automatically ({count})": "其餘會自動處理（{count}）",
  "The result could not be confirmed.": "無法確認結果。",
  "The result isn't confirmed yet.": "結果尚未確認。",
  "The saved value {value} is not in the current list. It stays selected until you pick another.": "已儲存的值 {value} 不在目前的清單中。在你改選其他項目之前，會繼續保持選取。",
  "The selected computer is no longer attached to this server. Refresh and choose another computer.": "所選電腦已不在此伺服器上。請重新整理並改選其他電腦。",
  "The selected destinations already received this forward.": "所選目標已收到這次轉傳。",
  "The selected destinations are no longer available. Review your selection and try again.": "所選目標已無法使用。請檢查所選目標後再試一次。",
  "The selected runtime is not installed on this computer": "所選的執行環境尚未安裝在這台電腦上",
  "The server also applied a plan-based history limit.": "伺服器也套用了依方案而定的歷史記錄限制。",
  "The server couldn't be connected. Try again, or choose another way to join.": "無法連結伺服器。請再試一次，或改用其他方式加入。",
  "The server hosting this Joint Channel has reached its Joint Channel limit. Ask its admin to make room, then accept the invite again.": "發起這個聯合頻道的伺服器已達聯合頻道數量上限。請對方的管理員騰出名額後，再重新接受邀請。",
  "The server's network security check blocked this address. Check the server's network or proxy settings.": "伺服器的網路安全檢查封鎖了這個位址。請檢查伺服器的網路或代理設定。",
  "The server's slug, from its address after /s/. Raft doesn't say whether that server exists, so check the slug: a link for the wrong one never works.": "伺服器的 slug，也就是網址中 /s/ 之後的部分。Raft 不會告訴你該伺服器是否存在，所以請核對 slug：slug 寫錯的連結永遠無法使用。",
  "The service returned a sign-in address that is not a secure web page, so Raft did not open it.": "該服務傳回的登入網址不是安全的網頁，因此 Raft 沒有開啟。",
  "The sign-in could not start. Try again.": "無法開始登入，請再試一次。",
  "The sign-in finished, but {runtime} is still not signed in. Try again.": "登入流程已結束，但 {runtime} 仍未登入。請再試一次。",
  "The sign-in request expired before the browser finished. Please try again.": "瀏覽器還沒完成，這次登入要求就已過期。請再試一次。",
  "The sign-in took too long and stopped. Try again.": "登入耗時過久，已停止。請再試一次。",
  "The sign-in was cancelled.": "登入已取消。",
  "The source computer produced transfer metadata that the target computer could not verify. Update Raft Computer on both computers, then try again.": "來源電腦產生的傳輸中繼資料無法通過目標電腦的驗證。請更新兩台電腦上的 Raft Computer，然後再試一次。",
  "The submission was rejected. Return to editing to change it, or retry the same content.": "送出遭到拒絕。你可以返回編輯修改內容，或以相同內容重試。",
  "The suggested computer is unavailable. Pick a computer to continue.": "建議的電腦目前無法使用，請選擇其他電腦以繼續。",
  "The target computer could not install the agent because that workspace already exists. Check which copy is current; move or back up the conflicting workspace, then try again. Raft will not delete it automatically.": "目標電腦無法安裝這個 Agent，因為該工作區已經存在。請確認哪一份是目前使用的副本，將衝突的工作區移走或備份，然後再試一次。Raft 不會自動刪除它。",
  "The target computer did not finish installing the workspace before the deadline. Make sure the target is running and has enough free disk space, then try again.": "目標電腦未能在期限內完成工作區安裝。請確認目標電腦正在執行，且有足夠的可用磁碟空間，然後再試一次。",
  "The target computer does not have enough free disk space to stage and install this migration. Free disk space and try again.": "目標電腦沒有足夠的可用磁碟空間來暫存並安裝這次遷移。請釋放磁碟空間，然後再試一次。",
  "The target computer found a previously completed copy of this workspace and stopped before replacing it. Confirm which copy is current; move or back up the old copy, then try again. Raft will not delete it automatically.": "目標電腦發現這個工作區先前已完成的副本，因此在取代它之前就停止了。請確認哪一份是目前使用的副本，將舊副本移走或備份，然後再試一次。Raft 不會自動刪除它。",
  "The target computer is offline. Start Raft Computer on it and try again.": "目標電腦已離線。請在該電腦上啟動 Raft Computer，然後再試一次。",
  "The target computer is still detecting its runtimes. Try again in a moment.": "目標電腦仍在偵測執行環境，請稍後再試。",
  "The target computer needs {required} free to stage and install this migration, but only {available} is available. Free disk space and try again.": "目標電腦需要 {required} 的可用空間來暫存並安裝這次遷移，但目前只有 {available} 可用。請釋放磁碟空間，然後再試一次。",
  "The target computer {target} did not finish installing the workspace before the deadline. Make sure the target is running and has enough free disk space, then try again.": "目標電腦 {target} 未能在截止時間前完成工作區安裝。請確認目標電腦正在執行且有足夠的可用磁碟空間，然後再試一次。",
  "The target computer's last runtime detection did not finish for {runtime}. Rescan its runtimes on the Computer page, then try again.": "目標電腦上次偵測執行環境時，未完成 {runtime} 的偵測。請在該電腦的頁面重新掃描執行環境，然後再試一次。",
  "The test request failed. Check the model, credential, and provider access.": "測試請求失敗。請檢查模型、憑證和供應商存取權限。",
  "The test was sent, but the system didn’t show it. Allow notifications for Raft in the system’s notification settings, and check that Do Not Disturb or Focus is off.": "測試通知已送出，但系統沒有顯示。請在系統的通知設定中允許 Raft 傳送通知，並確認勿擾或專注模式已關閉。",
  "The test was sent, but this browser didn’t show it. Check that notifications for this site are allowed in the browser and in your system settings, and that Do Not Disturb is off.": "測試通知已送出，但這個瀏覽器沒有顯示。請檢查瀏覽器和系統設定是否允許此網站傳送通知，並確認勿擾模式已關閉。",
  "The text changed while you were looking at it. Review the current text, then try again.": "你檢視期間文字已有變更。請檢視目前的文字後再試一次。",
  "The text this app adds to agent prompts just changed. Review the current text, then try again.": "此應用程式加入 Agent 提示詞的文字剛剛有所變更。請檢視目前的文字後再試一次。",
  "The token stays with the agent's cloud provider, never with Raft. The GitHub link works for 10 minutes.": "權杖由 Agent 的雲端供應商保管，不經過 Raft。GitHub 授權連結 10 分鐘內有效。",
  "The two-step verification reset you asked for by email can finish now, without your second step.": "你透過電子郵件申請的兩步驟驗證重設現在可以完成，不需要第二步驟驗證。",
  "The upgrade didn't complete; still on v{version}. Run {command} on that machine to check.": "升級未完成，目前仍是 v{version}。請在那台電腦上執行 {command} 檢查。",
  "The upload could not be completed.": "無法完成上傳。",
  "The upload response was lost. Retry to safely resume this upload.": "上傳回應遺失。請重試，以安全地接續這次上傳。",
  "The upload session could not be checked.": "無法檢查上傳工作階段。",
  "The upload session could not be created.": "無法建立上傳工作階段。",
  "The upload size limit could not be checked. Try again in a moment.": "無法確認上傳大小上限，請稍後再試。",
  "The upload stopped making progress. Check your connection and try again.": "上傳沒有進展。請檢查網路連線，然後再試一次。",
  "The upload to the cloud was interrupted. Make sure {source} is online, then try again.": "上傳到雲端的過程中斷了。請確認 {source} 已上線，然後再試一次。",
  "The user chooses the target agent when authorizing.": "使用者會在授權時選擇目標 Agent。",
  "The window is too narrow for another column.": "視窗太窄，放不下新的一欄。",
  "The workspace has too many files and folders to move. Ask the agent to delete folders it no longer needs, or to list them in .raftmigrateignore, then try again.": "工作區中的檔案和資料夾太多，無法遷移。請讓 Agent 刪除不再需要的資料夾，或將它們列入 .raftmigrateignore，然後再試一次。",
  "The workspace is deleted from {computer}. This cannot be undone.": "工作區將從 {computer} 中刪除，且無法復原。",
  "The workspace is removed from {computer}. The profile and messages stay.": "工作區會從 {computer} 中移除。個人檔案和訊息仍會保留。",
  "The workspace is uploaded. {target} is downloading it.": "工作區已上傳，{target} 正在下載。",
  "The workspace moved to {target}, but the agent did not start automatically.": "工作區已遷移到 {target}，但 Agent 沒有自動啟動。",
  "The workspace transfer did not finish before the deadline. Make sure both computers stay online and the target has enough free disk space, then try again.": "工作區傳輸未能在期限內完成。請確認兩台電腦都保持上線，且目標電腦有足夠的可用磁碟空間，然後再試一次。",
  "The workspace was not found on the Computer.": "在電腦上找不到這個工作區。",
  "The {runtime} key will be removed from {piRuntime} on {computer}.": "{computer} 上 {piRuntime} 的 {runtime} 金鑰將被移除。",
  "Their workspaces on your computers are lost. The agents themselves stay, with their messages and settings, and their owners can keep using them on another computer. Each owner gets a system notice.": "這些 Agent 在你電腦上的工作區會遺失；Agent 本身保留，訊息和設定都還在，主人可以換一台電腦繼續用。主人會收到系統通知。",
  "Theme on {serverName}": "{serverName} 的主題",
  "Theme": "主題",
  "There are {count} system updates: {parts}": "有 {count} 則系統更新：{parts}",
  "There are {parts}": "有 {parts}",
  "There's no owner to notify. Contact this server's owner or an admin: they can delete it, or on Pro, move it to another computer.": "沒有可以通知的主人。請聯絡這個伺服器的擁有者或管理員：他們可以刪除它，Pro 伺服器上還可以把它遷移到另一台電腦。",
  "These apps know who you are. Revoking signs you out of the app right away.": "這些應用程式知道你是誰。撤銷後，你會立即從該應用程式登出。",
  "These channels will become readable by anyone:": "以下頻道將開放給任何人閱讀：",
  "These drafts were already sent.": "這些草稿已經傳送過了。",
  "These files are too large to download as one zip. Download them one by one from Files.": "這些檔案太大，無法打包成一個 zip 下載。請在「檔案」裡逐一下載。",
  "These items can't be forwarded. Select regular messages instead.": "這些項目無法轉傳。請改選一般訊息。",
  "These messages are saved safely while later messages continue. Retry after the issue is resolved; a retried message keeps its original time and may appear before later messages.": "這些訊息已安全保留，後續訊息會繼續同步。問題解決後可重試；重試的訊息保留原始時間，可能出現在後續訊息之前。",
  "These messages can't be forwarded. Select regular messages instead.": "這些訊息無法轉傳。請改選一般訊息。",
  "These scopes are the exact capabilities this Login with Raft request will grant.": "以下權限範圍就是這次「使用 Raft 登入」要求會授予的全部能力。",
  "These settings were just changed on another device. The latest values are shown; try again.": "這些設定剛在另一台裝置上變更過，已顯示最新的值，請再試一次。",
  "These titles are too long to post as one message: shorten them or create fewer at once.": "這些標題太長，放不進一則訊息：縮短一些，或分幾次建立。",
  "They apply the next time it starts.": "下次啟動時套用。",
  "They apply when it's next idle.": "下次閒置時套用。",
  "They stop now.": "現在就停止。",
  "They'll see this channel's earlier messages.": "對方會看到這個頻道先前的訊息。",
  "They're all set up already — setup continues as soon as any one of them comes online.": "它們都已經設定好了——只要其中任一台上線，設定就會繼續。",
  "Thinking": "思考中",
  "Thinking…": "思考中…",
  "Third-party developer": "第三方開發者",
  "This Agent was deleted but still holds the assignment, which keeps the connection undeletable. Detach it to release the connection.": "此 Agent 已刪除，但仍指派使用此連線，導致連線無法刪除。解除指派即可釋出此連線。",
  "This App can't take another connection right now.": "這個應用程式目前無法再新增連線。",
  "This App has no recorded header names. Set them in MCP Server, then add the connection.": "這個應用程式尚未記錄任何標頭名稱。請先在「MCP 伺服器」中設定，再新增連線。",
  "This App only gets version 1 requests, so its previews have no buttons or block cards. To get them, answer version 2 and add 2 to <code>preview_versions</code> in its registration.": "這個 App 只會收到版本 1 的請求，所以預覽沒有按鈕，也不會顯示成 block 卡片。要使用這些功能，請讓 App 回應版本 2，並在註冊的 <code>preview_versions</code> 裡加上 2。",
  "This App's installation on this Server is suspended. Ask a Server owner or admin to restore it.": "此應用程式在此伺服器上的安裝已暫停。請伺服器擁有者或管理員恢復安裝。",
  "This App's sign-in settings can't be read right now. Try again in a moment.": "暫時無法讀取此應用程式的登入設定，請稍後再試。",
  "This Artifact didn't load": "這個 Artifact 沒有載入",
  "This Artifact isn't available any more.": "這個 Artifact 已經無法使用了。",
  "This Computer can't be upgraded from the web right now.": "目前無法從網頁升級這台電腦。",
  "This Computer cannot list the options for this runtime.": "這台電腦無法列出此執行環境的選項。",
  "This Computer could not list the options.": "這台電腦無法列出選項。",
  "This Computer did not answer in time, so these options may be out of date.": "這台電腦未能及時回應，選項可能不是最新的。",
  "This Computer did not answer in time, so this skill list may be out of date.": "這台電腦未能及時回應，技能清單可能不是最新的。",
  "This Computer has no owner, so its runtimes can't be connected from here": "這台電腦沒有擁有者，因此無法在這裡為它的執行環境連接服務商",
  "This Computer has no owner, so its runtimes can't be signed in from here": "這台電腦沒有擁有者，因此無法在這裡為它的執行環境登入",
  "This Computer is offline. Connect it, then try again.": "這台電腦已離線。請連線後再試一次。",
  "This Computer is offline. Reconnect it, then retry.": "這台電腦已離線。請重新連線後重試。",
  "This Computer is offline.": "這台電腦已離線。",
  "This Computer is too old to verify Built-in models. Your saved selection is preserved; update Raft Computer before changing it.": "這台電腦的版本過舊，無法驗證 Built-in 模型。已保留你儲存的選擇；請先更新 Raft Computer，再變更模型。",
  "This Computer or runtime wasn't found.": "找不到這台電腦或執行環境。",
  "This Computer reported no available options.": "這台電腦沒有回報任何可用的選項。",
  "This Computer runs under your own systemd unit {unit} (KillMode={killMode}), which stops a web upgrade on this version. On that machine: stop the unit ({stopCommand}), run the install command below once, then start the unit again ({startCommand}).": "這台 Computer 執行在你自己的 systemd 單元 {unit}（KillMode={killMode}）下，這個版本從網頁升級會被它中斷。請在那台電腦上：先停止該單元（{stopCommand}），執行一次下面的安裝指令，再重新啟動該單元（{startCommand}）。",
  "This Computer runs under your own systemd unit, whose KillMode stops a web upgrade on this version. On that machine: stop the unit, run the install command below once, then start the unit again.": "這台 Computer 執行在你自己的 systemd 單元下，這個版本從網頁升級會被它的 KillMode 中斷。請在那台電腦上：先停止該單元，執行一次下面的安裝指令，再重新啟動該單元。",
  "This Computer took too long to list the options.": "這台電腦列出選項的時間過長。",
  "This Computer's catalog does not list this model. You can still select it; compatibility will be checked when the agent starts.": "這台電腦的目錄中沒有列出這個模型。你仍可選擇它，相容性會在 Agent 啟動時檢查。",
  "This Computer's model catalog is unavailable. You can choose from the standard Built-in models, but saving may be refused until the catalog can be read; retry later or choose another Computer.": "目前無法取得這台電腦的模型目錄。你仍可從標準 Built-in 模型中選擇，但在能讀取目錄之前，儲存可能會遭拒；請稍後重試，或改用其他電腦。",
  "This Computer's version is too old to report what happened to the upgrade: it may not be running as a service, or the installer stopped early. Run {command} on that machine; the result shows in the terminal.": "這台電腦版本較舊，沒能回報升級結果：它可能不是以服務方式執行，或者安裝程式中途停了。請在那台電腦上執行 {command}，結果會直接顯示在終端機裡。",
  "This Connection belongs to someone else. An agent can use the App's default Connection or one its owner created.": "這個連線屬於其他人。Agent 只能使用此應用程式的預設連線，或其擁有者建立的連線。",
  "This Joint Channel already has 2 free servers. Upgrade either side to Pro, or have a free server leave, to continue (30 servers max).": "這個聯合頻道已有 2 個免費版伺服器。請將任一方升級到 Pro，或請一個免費版伺服器離開後再繼續（伺服器上限為 30 個）。",
  "This Joint Channel has more than 2 free servers and becomes read-only on {deadline}. To keep it writable, one server's admin needs to upgrade, or a free server needs to leave.": "此聯合頻道中有超過 2 個使用免費方案的伺服器，將於 {deadline} 變為唯讀。若要維持可寫入，需要其中一個伺服器的管理員升級，或有一個免費方案伺服器離開。",
  "This Joint Channel has unfinished uploads. Open the channel to let the original composer continue, or cancel an upload here.": "這個聯合頻道還有未完成的附件上傳。開啟頻道即可讓原本的輸入框繼續上傳，或直接在這裡取消上傳。",
  "This Joint Channel is read-only because it has more than 2 free servers. It becomes writable again when one server's admin upgrades or a free server leaves.": "此聯合頻道中有超過 2 個使用免費方案的伺服器，因此目前為唯讀。只要其中一個伺服器的管理員升級，或有一個免費方案伺服器離開，就會恢復為可寫入。",
  "This MCP App no longer exists.": "這個 MCP 應用程式已不存在。",
  "This Mac": "這台 Mac",
  "This QR code has expired. Please refresh later or contact the Raft team.": "這個 QR Code 已過期。請稍後重新整理，或聯絡 Raft 團隊。",
  "This account has no password yet: set one with Forgot Password on the sign-in page, then sign in to finish it.": "這個帳號還沒有密碼：請先在登入頁面使用「忘記密碼？」設定密碼，再登入完成重設。",
  "This account has only Claude's older once-a-week 5-hour reset, so there is nothing else to list. When you reach your 5-hour limit, use it with Use 5-hour reset on the card.": "這個帳號只有 Claude 舊版的每週一次 5 小時重設，沒有其他可列出的。達到 5 小時上限時，請用卡片上的「使用 5 小時重設」。",
  "This action card requires the specified computer": "這張操作卡片必須使用指定的電腦",
  "This action needs your second step first.": "執行這項操作前，需要先通過第二步驟驗證。",
  "This action runs on {server}. Switch to {server} to run it.": "這個操作會在 {server} 上執行，請切換到 {server} 後再執行。",
  "This agent already has a migration in progress. Wait for it to finish before trying again.": "這個 Agent 已有正在進行的遷移。請等它完成後再試。",
  "This agent has already run in the cloud, so it cannot move there again.": "這個 Agent 已在雲端執行過，無法再次遷移到雲端。",
  "This agent has been terminated or is no longer available in this server.": "這個 Agent 已被終止，或已無法在此伺服器中使用。",
  "This agent hasn't scheduled anything. To set one, just tell your agent: \"remind me tomorrow to follow up.\"": "此 Agent 尚未排定任何提醒。想設定提醒，只要告訴你的 Agent：「明天提醒我追蹤後續。」",
  "This agent is being migrated. Wait for the migration to finish or cancel it, then archive it.": "這個 Agent 正在遷移中。請等遷移完成或取消遷移後再封存。",
  "This agent is no longer available. Refresh and try again.": "這個 Agent 已不存在。請重新整理後再試一次。",
  "This agent is not on any computer, so there is nothing to bring over. It moves to the computer you choose and starts a fresh session there the next time it gets a message.": "這個 Agent 目前不在任何電腦上，沒有需要移轉的檔案。它會移到你選擇的電腦，並在下次收到訊息時在那裡開始新的工作階段。",
  "This agent reads selected sources and submits dashboard results. It does not reply to DMs. Open its card to inspect it.": "此 Agent 會讀取所選來源並提交儀表板結果，不會回覆私訊。開啟它的卡片即可檢視詳細資料。",
  "This agent uses a deprecated runtime. It can keep running, but new agents cannot select this runtime.": "這個 Agent 使用的執行環境已淘汰。它可以繼續執行，但新的 Agent 無法選擇這個執行環境。",
  "This agent's Computer is offline.": "這個 Agent 所在的電腦已離線。",
  "This agent's Computer lost its access to the server, so its files can't be brought over. It moves to the computer you choose and starts a fresh session there the next time it gets a message.": "這個 Agent 所在的電腦已失去伺服器的存取權，無法帶走它的檔案。它會移到你選擇的電腦，並在下次收到訊息時在那裡開始新的工作階段。",
  "This also archives it for every other server in the channel.": "其他所有伺服器上的這個頻道也會一併封存。",
  "This also opts this server out of automatic installation. It stays uninstalled until an owner or admin explicitly installs it again.": "這也會讓此伺服器不再自動安裝此應用程式。除非擁有者或管理員再次手動安裝，否則它會維持解除安裝的狀態。",
  "This app can no longer be installed from this request. Ask {agent} to prepare a fresh one.": "這個應用程式已無法透過這個要求安裝。請讓 {agent} 重新準備一個。",
  "This app cannot: send chat as you · speak as the agent · read your messages · take actions for you. It can only deliver event/notification payloads to the single agent you select.": "此應用程式無法：以你的身分傳送訊息 · 以該 Agent 的身分發言 · 讀取你的訊息 · 代你執行操作。它只能將事件/通知內容傳送給你選定的那一個 Agent。",
  "This app changed the text it adds to agent prompts. Until an admin confirms it, agents keep using the last confirmed version. Confirmed text reaches each agent the next time it starts.": "此應用程式變更了要加入 Agent 提示詞的文字。在管理員確認前，Agent 會繼續使用上次確認的版本。確認後的文字會在每個 Agent 下次啟動時生效。",
  "This app is published in the Marketplace. Offline approval preserves the source Server’s installation and access, but removes installations and access on other Servers.": "此應用程式已在市集上架。核准下架後，來源伺服器的安裝與存取權會保留，但其他伺服器上的安裝與存取權都會被移除。",
  "This app is published, so changes to its name, description and When to use go through Raft review first, then each Server's admins confirm them. Until then, agents keep using the last confirmed text.": "此應用程式已發布，因此名稱、說明和「使用時機」的變更須先經過 Raft 審核，再由各伺服器的管理員確認。在此之前，Agent 會繼續使用上次確認的文字。",
  "This app is set up to sign in through a Server-specific address, which it can't use. Ask the app's developer to use Raft's main sign-in address.": "這個應用程式被設定為透過伺服器專屬位址登入，但它無法使用這種位址。請應用程式開發者改用 Raft 的主要登入位址。",
  "This app isn't available to you": "這個應用程式不對你開放",
  "This app requests access to the agent directory in your selected Server, along with the other permissions listed below.": "此應用程式要求存取你所選伺服器中的 Agent 清單，以及下方列出的其他權限。",
  "This app requests new access. Review it before approving the update; until then it keeps the access you approved.": "此應用程式要求新的存取權。請在核准更新前先檢視；在此之前，它仍維持你先前核准的存取權。",
  "This app's installations on your Servers are suspended. Ask a Server owner or admin to restore it.": "此應用程式在你的伺服器上的安裝已暫停。請伺服器擁有者或管理員恢復安裝。",
  "This app's permissions just changed. Review the current permissions below, then install again.": "此應用程式的權限剛剛有所變更。請檢視下方目前的權限，再重新安裝。",
  "This app's permissions just changed. Review the current permissions, then confirm again.": "此應用程式的權限剛剛有所變更，請檢查目前的權限後再確認一次。",
  "This attachment is already saved as an Artifact you can't see.": "這個附件已經存為一個你看不到的 Artifact。",
  "This attachment isn't available any more.": "這個附件已經不在了。",
  "This browser can't create passkeys. Add one from a browser that supports them, such as a recent Chrome, Safari, Edge or Firefox.": "這個瀏覽器無法建立通行密鑰。請改用支援通行密鑰的瀏覽器新增，例如新版 Chrome、Safari、Edge 或 Firefox。",
  "This browser can't use passkeys. Use another way, or open Raft in a browser that has your passkey.": "這個瀏覽器無法使用通行密鑰。請改用其他方式，或在存有你通行密鑰的瀏覽器中開啟 Raft。",
  "This browser does not expose the Notification API, so it cannot show system notifications for Raft.": "此瀏覽器未提供 Notification API，因此無法為 Raft 顯示系統通知。",
  "This browser does not support Web Push.": "此瀏覽器不支援網頁推播（Web Push）。",
  "This browser does not support service worker push notifications.": "此瀏覽器不支援 Service Worker 推播通知。",
  "This browser no longer has the original file, so it cannot safely continue the upload. Cancel it here, or let the original tab finish uploading.": "這個瀏覽器已經沒有原始檔案，無法安全地繼續上傳。你可以在這裡取消，或讓原本的分頁完成上傳。",
  "This button was already used.": "此按鈕已經使用過了。",
  "This can't be undone.": "此操作無法復原。",
  "This card changed. Check it and try again.": "此卡片內容已變更，請確認後再試一次。",
  "This card was out of date and has been refreshed. Try again.": "此卡片內容已過時，已為你重新整理，請再試一次。",
  "This channel can't be visible to visitors: only an ordinary channel with no people or invites from outside this server can be.": "這個頻道無法對遊客可見：只有沒有外部成員和外部邀請的一般頻道才可以。",
  "This channel can't take external invites right now.": "這個頻道目前無法傳送外部邀請。",
  "This channel has guests, guest servers or pending invites, so it has to stay private.": "這個頻道有訪客、訪客伺服器或待接受的邀請，因此必須維持為私人頻道。",
  "This channel has {room, plural, one {# slot} other {# slots}} left. Remove {count} to continue.": "這個頻道只剩 {room, plural, other {# 個名額}}，請移除 {count} 個再繼續。",
  "This channel is archived, so its actions can no longer be run.": "這個頻道已封存，卡片上的操作無法再執行。",
  "This channel is archived: unarchive it to create tasks in it.": "這個頻道已封存：取消封存後才能在這裡建立任務。",
  "This channel is full. Withdraw an open invite or remove a guest to make room.": "這個頻道已滿。撤回一個尚未接受的邀請或移除一位訪客，即可騰出名額。",
  "This channel is full. Withdraw an open invite, remove a guest or disconnect a server to make room.": "這個頻道已滿。撤回一個尚未接受的邀請、移除一位訪客或中斷一個伺服器的連結，即可騰出名額。",
  "This channel is read-only on your current plan, so tasks can't be created in it.": "依你目前的方案，這個頻道是唯讀的，無法在這裡建立任務。",
  "This channel is read-only on your current plan. Upgrade to continue.": "在目前的方案下，此頻道為唯讀。升級即可繼續使用。",
  "This clears the setup and takes you back to the beginning. Nothing is lost — this server has no agents yet.": "這會清除目前的設定並回到起點。不會遺失任何內容——此伺服器還沒有 Agent。",
  "This cloud agent no longer exists in the cloud. Connections are unavailable; recreate the agent.": "這個雲端 Agent 已不存在於雲端，因此無法使用帳號連結；請重新建立這個 Agent。",
  "This comment is too long.": "留言太長了。",
  "This computer doesn't report its version, so it's too old for Raft. Reinstall it to keep its agents running. Run this on that machine:": "這台電腦沒有回報版本，表示它對 Raft 來說太舊了。請重新安裝，讓它上面的 Agent 繼續執行。請在那台電腦上執行：",
  "This computer doesn't report its version": "這台電腦沒有回報版本",
  "This computer is not connected to the server yet — enable it first.": "這台電腦尚未連接到伺服器——請先在「電腦」中啟用它。",
  "This computer": "這台電腦",
  "This connection changed while you were editing. Refresh before trying again.": "編輯期間連線已變更，請重新整理後再試。",
  "This connection link expired or was already used. Start again from the agent's profile.": "此連結網址已過期或已使用過。請從 Agent 的個人檔案重新開始。",
  "This connection link is invalid or incomplete.": "此連結網址無效或不完整。",
  "This connection no longer exists.": "這個連線已不存在。",
  "This connection was authorized before Raft recorded who authorized it, so Raft cannot confirm that the paired private channels are visible to that person, and those pairs have stopped syncing. A server owner or admin needs to update the Slack authorization with an account that belongs to those channels.": "這個連線是在 Raft 開始記錄授權人之前授權的，Raft 無法確認授權人能看到已配對的私人頻道，這些配對已停止同步。需要伺服器擁有者或管理員使用已加入這些頻道的帳號更新 Slack 授權。",
  "This connection was authorized before Raft recorded who authorized it, so Raft cannot confirm that the paired private channels are visible to that person, and those pairs have stopped syncing. Retrying the check will not fix this. Update the Slack authorization with an account that belongs to those channels.": "這個連線是在 Raft 開始記錄授權人之前授權的，Raft 無法確認授權人能看到已配對的私人頻道，這些配對已停止同步。重試檢查無法解決，請使用已加入這些頻道的帳號更新 Slack 授權。",
  "This connection was started by another user. It was not confirmed and will expire on its own.": "此連結是由其他使用者發起的，尚未經過確認，將會自動失效。",
  "This conversation isn't available to you": "這個對話你無法開啟",
  "This conversion can no longer be canceled. Its current status is shown below.": "此轉換已無法取消，目前狀態顯示如下。",
  "This deployment has no translation provider configured, so translations cannot run yet.": "此部署尚未設定翻譯服務供應商，因此暫時無法翻譯。",
  "This desktop build cannot show system notifications.": "此桌面版本無法顯示系統通知。",
  "This device won't receive notifications": "這部裝置不會收到通知",
  "This device": "本機",
  "This didn't load": "無法載入此內容",
  "This draft changed after it was submitted. Close the form, start a new draft, and try again.": "這份草稿在送出後有所變更。請關閉表單、建立新草稿後再試一次。",
  "This email already has a Raft account created another way. Sign in with email and password (or an email code) first, then link {provider} in Settings → Connected accounts.": "這個電子郵件已有一個用其他方式建立的 Raft 帳號。請先用電子郵件和密碼（或電子郵件驗證碼）登入，再到「設定 → 已連結帳號」連結 {provider}。",
  "This email already has a Raft account. Sign in the way you usually do, and we'll connect {provider} and take you into Raft.": "這個電子郵件地址已有 Raft 帳號。請用平常的方式登入，登入後會自動連結 {provider} 並帶你進入 Raft。",
  "This field is required.": "此欄位為必填。",
  "This file can't be previewed here yet.": "這裡還不能預覽這個檔案。",
  "This file is too large to save as an Artifact.": "這個檔案太大，無法存為 Artifact。",
  "This fills the channel.": "送出後頻道就滿了。",
  "This gateway supports image input": "此閘道支援圖片輸入",
  "This image expired before it was sent. Remove it and attach it again.": "這張圖片在傳送前已過期。請移除後重新新增。",
  "This in-app browser cannot complete secure sign-in. Continue in Safari, Chrome, or your system browser.": "應用程式內建瀏覽器無法完成安全登入，請改用 Safari、Chrome 或系統瀏覽器繼續。",
  "This invite isn't for this account": "這個邀請不是傳給此帳號的",
  "This invite link is invalid or has expired.": "此邀請連結無效或已過期。",
  "This invite link is not valid": "這個邀請連結無效",
  "This invite was already accepted, withdrawn or has expired.": "這個邀請已被接受、撤回，或已過期。",
  "This invite was sent to {email}. Sign in or create an account with that address to join the channel and start working with them.": "這個邀請寄給了 {email}。用這個信箱登入或建立帳號，就能加入頻道，開始和他們協作。",
  "This invite was sent to {email}. Sign in with that address to accept it.": "這個邀請是寄給 {email} 的。用這個信箱登入後即可接受。",
  "This is the computer I just set up{hostname}.": "這是我剛才設定的電腦{hostname}。",
  "This is the server default: Agents that follow the default are refused too, until someone signs in again or you choose another default.": "這是伺服器預設連線：跟隨預設的 Agent 也會被拒絕，直到有人再次登入，或你選定其他預設連線。",
  "This is the server default: Agents that follow the default will be refused too, until you choose a new default.": "這是伺服器預設連線：在你選定新的預設連線之前，跟隨預設的 Agent 也會被拒絕。",
  "This is your only passkey or authenticator app, so it can't be deleted while two-step verification is on. Add another passkey first, or <turnOff>turn off two-step verification</turnOff>.": "這是你唯一的通行密鑰或驗證器 App，因此在兩步驟驗證開啟期間無法刪除。請先新增另一個通行密鑰，或<turnOff>關閉兩步驟驗證</turnOff>。",
  "This kind of request is no longer available. Ask the agent to send a new request.": "這類請求已無法使用。請讓 Agent 重新傳送請求。",
  "This link uses the {protocol} protocol and will open in an external application:": "此連結使用 {protocol} 通訊協定，將在外部應用程式中開啟：",
  "This link will show a seat-limit message until you add a human seat.": "在你新增真人席位之前，此連結會顯示席位已達上限的訊息。",
  "This mention action could not be applied.": "無法套用此提及操作。",
  "This mention action has expired.": "此提及操作已過期。",
  "This mention action is no longer available.": "此提及操作已無法使用。",
  "This mention action is no longer pending.": "此提及操作已不在待處理狀態。",
  "This mention action is not available for the current channel state.": "在頻道目前的狀態下，無法使用此提及操作。",
  "This mention action matched more than one target. Refresh and try again.": "此提及操作符合多個對象。請重新整理後再試一次。",
  "This message is older than the {days}-day history available on the {plan} plan. Upgrade to view it.": "這則訊息早於 {plan} 方案可檢視的 {days} 天歷史範圍，升級後即可檢視。",
  "This message is older than {days} days.": "這則訊息已超過 {days} 天。",
  "This message is too long to send as a task: shorten it.": "這則訊息太長，無法以任務形式傳送：請縮短一些。",
  "This message was retracted.": "這則訊息已收回。",
  "This migration is no longer available. Refresh the migration status.": "這次遷移已不存在。請重新整理遷移狀態。",
  "This migration is not waiting for your confirmation any more. Refresh to see where it stands.": "這次遷移已不再等待你確認。請重新整理以查看目前狀態。",
  "This model is a catalog suggestion and has not been verified to launch with this computer's current runtime config.": "此模型僅為目錄建議，尚未驗證能否以這台電腦目前的執行環境設定啟動。",
  "This model may be using Raft default limits": "這個模型可能在用 Raft 預設上限",
  "This month's uploads are used up": "本月的上傳額度已用完",
  "This needs a fresh second step. It lasts 10 minutes.": "這項操作需要重新進行第二步驟驗證，驗證後 10 分鐘內有效。",
  "This page can’t be shown here": "無法在這裡顯示此頁面",
  "This page hit an error": "頁面出錯了",
  "This page is not served over HTTPS, so the browser will not register a service worker for push notifications.": "此頁面並非透過 HTTPS 提供，因此瀏覽器不會為推播通知註冊 Service Worker。",
  "This page is out of date. Reload it, review the app's permissions, then try again.": "此頁面已過期。請重新載入，檢視應用程式的權限後再試一次。",
  "This permanently deletes the app's OAuth client, secret, and all grants. Any existing Login with Raft setup using ": "這會永久刪除此應用程式的 OAuth 用戶端、密鑰和所有授權。所有使用 ",
  "This pilot is off by default and only available to explicitly enrolled servers.": "此試行功能預設為關閉，僅開放給明確加入的伺服器。",
  "This read-only analysis agent does not reply to DMs. Results appear on the RaftBench page.": "這是唯讀的分析 Agent，不會回覆私訊。結果會顯示在 RaftBench 頁面。",
  "This recommended app is no longer available.": "這個推薦應用程式已不再提供。",
  "This removes the marketplace app from this server and revokes its existing Login with Raft access for agents on this server. Active grants and tokens will be revoked, and pending agent login requests will be denied. Agents must get a fresh approval before using ": "這會從此伺服器移除此市集應用程式，並撤銷此伺服器上 Agent 現有的「使用 Raft 登入」存取權限。有效的授權和 Token 將被撤銷，待處理的 Agent 登入請求將被拒絕。Agent 必須重新取得核准，才能再次使用 ",
  "This replaces your current photo when you save.": "儲存後會取代你現在的照片。",
  "This report may contain <strong>prompt history, file paths, and command output</strong>. Sensitive data redaction is best-effort and not guaranteed.": "這份回報可能包含<strong>提示詞記錄、檔案路徑和指令輸出</strong>。敏感資料會盡量遮蔽，但無法保證完全遮蔽。",
  "This request can no longer be approved.": "這項申請已無法核准。",
  "This request has expired": "這項申請已過期",
  "This request link is not valid": "這個申請連結無效",
  "This request was canceled": "這項申請已取消",
  "This request was prepared before Raft recorded the app's permissions on it, so it can't be installed from here. Ask {agent} to prepare a fresh one.": "這個要求是在 Raft 記錄應用程式權限之前準備的，因此無法從這裡安裝。請讓 {agent} 重新準備一個。",
  "This request was refused before it reached the Computer. No reset was used.": "請求在到達電腦之前就被拒絕了。沒有用掉任何重設。",
  "This reset already went through.": "這次重設已經生效。",
