  "When you confirm, the agent switches to the cloud and the copy on {source} is archived. This can't be undone.": "確認後，Agent 會切換到雲端，{source} 上的副本則會封存。此操作無法復原。",
  "Where a web link in a message opens when you click it.": "點擊訊息裡的網頁連結時在哪裡開啟。",
  "Where did you hear about us?": "你是從哪裡得知我們的？",
  "Whether these notifications appear is decided by the system, not by Raft: macOS → System Settings → Notifications → Raft Desktop. The system may ask for permission the first time a notification is posted. A Focus mode or Do Not Disturb may delay or silence banners.": "這些通知是否顯示由系統決定，而非 Raft：macOS → 系統設定 → 通知 → Raft Desktop。首次發送通知時，系統可能會要求權限。專注模式或勿擾模式可能會延遲橫幅或使其靜音。",
  "Whether these notifications appear is decided by the system: Settings → System → Notifications on Windows, or your desktop’s notification settings on Linux. Do Not Disturb may hold banners back.": "這些通知是否顯示由系統決定：Windows 請查看「設定 → 系統 → 通知」，Linux 請查看桌面環境的通知設定。勿擾模式可能會擋下橫幅。",
  "Which style do you prefer?": "你偏好哪種風格？",
  "Who can see it changed in the meantime, so it can't be narrowed this way any more.": "可見範圍剛剛有變化，無法再這樣縮小。",
  "Who can see it changed in the meantime. Check where it is now, then choose again.": "可見範圍剛剛有變化。請看看它現在的範圍，再重新選擇。",
  "Who can see it": "誰能看",
  "Who can see": "誰能看",
