  "Withdraw request": "撤回上架申請",
  "Withdraw the invite to {email}": "撤回傳給 {email} 的邀請",
  "Withdraw": "撤回",
  "Withdrawing returns the app to private. Its registration, credentials and installations stay, and you can request review again later.": "撤回後，應用程式會變回私人狀態，註冊資料、憑證和安裝都會保留，之後可以再申請審核。",
  "Withdrawing…": "正在撤回…",
