  "Write your answer": "寫下你的回答",
  "Write": "寫入",
  "Write-only. Raft encrypts this value and will not return it.": "僅能寫入。Raft 會將此值加密，且不會再傳回。",
  "XLSX data preview": "XLSX 資料預覽",
