  "Yearly": "每年",
  "Yellow": "黃",
  "Yes": "是",
  "Yesterday": "昨天",
  "You are connected to Raft, a shared workspace for humans and agents. Treat Raft as your primary collaboration surface with people and other agents; use the terminal as a tool for local work. If you need the operating guide, run raft manual get raft-cli-overview.": "你已連線到 Raft，這是真人與 Agent 共用的工作區。請將 Raft 視為你與人和其他 Agent 協作的主要空間；終端機則是處理本機工作的工具。如需操作指南，請執行 raft manual get raft-cli-overview。",
  "You are the last member of this private channel. When you leave, the channel and its messages are deleted and cannot be recovered.": "你是這個私人頻道的最後一位成員。離開後，頻道和裡面的訊息會被刪除，無法復原。",
  "You are viewing public channels without signing in. Sign in or create an account to continue in Raft.": "你正在未登入的狀態下瀏覽公開頻道。登入或建立帳號即可繼續使用 Raft。",
  "You are viewing this public server without joining it.": "你正在瀏覽此公開伺服器，但尚未加入。",
  "You attached {computers, plural, one {# Computer} other {# Computers}} here: {names}. {computers, plural, one {It stays} other {They stay}} online while you're a member. If you leave this server later, {computers, plural, one {it goes} other {they go}} offline until someone in the server sets up that machine again.": "你在這裡加入了 {computers, plural, other {# 台電腦}}：{names}。只要你還是成員，就會保持在線。如果你之後離開這個伺服器，就會離線，直到伺服器裡有人重新設定那台機器。",
  "You authorized a different Slack workspace (or app) than the one this Raft server is already connected to. Authorize the same workspace, or disconnect it first.": "你授權的 Slack 工作區（或應用程式）與此 Raft 伺服器已連結的不同。請授權同一個工作區，或先中斷其連結。",
  "You can add members here, but creating Agents on this server needs an owner or admin. Ask one to grant the permission, or have them create the Agent so you can add it.": "你可以在這裡新增成員，但在此伺服器建立 Agent 需要擁有者或管理員。請他們開放權限給你，或請他們建立 Agent 後再由你新增。",
  "You can also": "也可以",
  "You can connect {count} more.": "還能連結 {count} 個。",
  "You can customize the agent again after updating its identity.": "更新身分後，你仍可再次自訂這個 Agent。",
  "You can have up to {count} tabs open": "最多可開啟 {count} 個分頁",
  "You can invite {count} more.": "還能邀請 {count} 位。",
  "You can no longer approve this request": "你已無法核准這項申請",
  "You can no longer change who can see it. Send it as it is, or cancel.": "你現在無法擴大它的可見範圍。可以照樣傳，或取消。",
  "You can remind again {time}": "{time}可以再提醒",
  "You can remind once every 24 hours": "每 24 小時只能提醒一次",
  "You can see how this Agent uses the App, but you can't change it.": "你可以檢視這個 Agent 如何使用此應用程式，但無法變更。",
  "You can withdraw this invite once its server finishes connecting.": "這個邀請的伺服器完成連結後，才能撤回邀請。",
  "You can't change who can see this Artifact.": "你不能變更這個 Artifact 的可見範圍。",
  "You can't connect servers to {channel} anymore.": "你已無法再將伺服器連結到 {channel}。",
  "You can't invite this server to its own joint channel.": "無法邀請此伺服器加入它自己的聯合頻道。",
  "You can't open this anymore": "你已無法再開啟它",
  "You can't rename this Artifact.": "你不能重新命名這個 Artifact。",
  "You can't see that conversation any more, so it can't go back there.": "你已經看不到那個對話了，所以它回不去了。",
  "You can't sign in or verify with this passkey after this. It stays in your password manager until you remove it there too. Your other browsers are signed out. Computers and the raft CLI stay connected.": "刪除後，你將無法再用這個通行密鑰登入或驗證。它會留在你的密碼管理工具中，直到你也在那裡移除它。你在其他瀏覽器上的登入都會被登出。電腦和 raft CLI 會保持連線。",
  "You don't have permission to do this.": "你沒有執行此操作的權限。",
  "You have a new message": "你有一則新訊息",
  "You have a new notice": "你有一則新通知",
  "You have a task update": "你有一則任務更新",
  "You marked these channels visible to Guests earlier. That choice will now apply to everyone, not only the Guests you invited. You will not be asked again for each channel.": "你先前已將這些頻道設為「訪客可見」。此設定現在將套用至所有人，而不再僅限於你邀請的訪客。系統不會再逐一詢問每個頻道。",
  "You may contact me about this feedback": "可以就這則意見回饋與我聯絡",
  "You must agree to the Terms of Service and acknowledge the Privacy Policy to create an account.": "你必須同意服務條款並確認已閱讀隱私權政策，才能建立帳號。",
  "You need admin access on this server to run a computer here.": "你需要此伺服器的管理員權限，才能在這裡執行電腦服務。",
  "You need admin access on this server.": "你需要此伺服器的管理員權限。",
  "You need permission to migrate agents, or you must be the agent's human creator.": "你需要遷移 Agent 的權限，或必須是這個 Agent 的真人建立者。",
  "You need the Create Agents permission — ask a server owner or admin to run this.": "你沒有「建立 Agent」的權限，請讓伺服器擁有者或管理員來執行。",
  "You need to be an owner or admin of a server to install this app.": "你必須是某個伺服器的擁有者或管理員，才能安裝此應用程式。",
  "You no longer have access to it.": "你已沒有存取權限。",
  "You no longer have access to that channel, so this mention action was not applied.": "你已無法存取該頻道，因此未套用此提及操作。",
  "You no longer have permission to update this connection, or it has been disconnected. Refresh to check its current state.": "你已無權修改此連線，或連線已中斷。請重新整理查看目前狀態。",
  "You selected another Slack workspace. Reauthorize the connected workspace, or disconnect it before switching.": "你選擇了另一個 Slack 工作區。請重新授權目前連線的工作區；如需更換，請先中斷目前工作區。",
  "You sent this; it's for the other person to act on.": "這是你送出的要求，需由對方處理。",
  "You signed in to a different account than {email}, so {provider} wasn't connected. Please sign in with {email}.": "你登入的不是 {email} 的帳號，因此未連結 {provider}。請使用 {email} 登入。",
  "You were mentioned": "有人提到了你",
  "You will lose access to this server's channels and DMs. You can rejoin if invited again.": "你將無法再存取此伺服器的頻道和私訊。若再次受邀，可以重新加入。",
  "You'll be in {channel} through {server}, not as a guest. If {server} is disconnected later and it's your only way in, you leave the channel.": "你會透過 {server} 留在 {channel}，而不是以訪客身分。如果之後 {server} 被中斷連結，而它是你進入這個頻道的唯一途徑，你就會離開頻道。",
  "You'll be signed in here. You can turn two-step verification on again in Settings › Account.": "你會在這裡登入。之後可以在「設定 › 帳號」中重新開啟兩步驟驗證。",
  "You'll find it in the server you connected.": "你可以在你連結的伺服器中找到它。",
  "You'll find it in {target}.": "你可以在 {target} 中找到它。",
  "You'll join {channel} in {server} and work with the humans and agents there.": "你會加入 {server} 中的 {channel}，和那裡的真人與 Agent 協作。",
  "You'll lose access to {serverName} and all of its channels. You can be re-invited later.": "你將失去 {serverName} 及其所有頻道的存取權。之後仍可再次受邀加入。",
  "You'll need to reconnect GitHub once after the move.": "遷移後，你需要重新連結 GitHub 一次。",
  "You'll own the new server, and it will connect to {channel} in {server}.": "你將成為新伺服器的擁有者，它會連結到 {server} 中的 {channel}。",
  "You'll see things here that need your attention.": "需要你注意的事項會顯示在這裡。",
  "You'll stop getting messages from #{name} and can't post there. To come back, a member has to invite you again.": "你將不再收到 #{name} 的訊息，也不能在裡面發言。之後需要成員重新邀請你才能回來。",
  "You'll stop getting messages from #{name} and can't post there. To come back, an admin has to invite you again.": "你將不再收到 #{name} 的訊息，也不能在裡面發言。之後需要管理員重新邀請你才能回來。",
  "You'll stop getting messages from #{name} and can't post there. You can rejoin any time. Threads you follow will still notify you until you unfollow them.": "你將不再收到 #{name} 的訊息，也不能在裡面發言，隨時可以重新加入。你追蹤的討論串仍會通知你，直到你取消追蹤。",
  "You're already a guest in another channel, so you can't join {channel} as a guest. Connect or create a server instead.": "你已是另一個頻道的訪客，因此無法以訪客身分加入 {channel}。請改為連結或建立一個伺服器。",
  "You're already a member of {server}. Ask an admin there to add you to {channel}.": "你已經是 {server} 的成員。請該伺服器的管理員將你加入 {channel}。",
  "You're an admin of both {source} and {target}. The connection will be made directly as admin of both, and no email will be sent.": "你同時是 {source} 和 {target} 的管理員。系統會以兩邊管理員的身分直接建立連結，不會傳送電子郵件。",
  "You're an admin": "你是管理員",
  "You're at your 5-hour limit. Checking or using a reset opens Claude Code on this Computer for a moment and sends one small request, which counts against your 5-hour window. On some Claude accounts (those with only the older once-a-week 5-hour reset), just opening Claude Code's reset list now uses that 5-hour reset right away, without asking. Continue only if that's OK.": "你已達到 5 小時上限。查看或使用重設時，會在這台電腦上短暫開啟 Claude Code，並送出一個小請求，計入你的 5 小時額度。部分 Claude 帳號（只有舊版每週一次 5 小時重設的）此時只要開啟 Claude Code 的重設清單，就會立即用掉這次 5 小時重設，不會詢問。只有在你能接受時才繼續。",
  "You're in": "加入成功",
  "You're invited to a channel": "你收到了一個頻道邀請",
  "You're invited": "你收到了邀請",
  "You're no longer a member of {target}.": "你已不是 {target} 的成員。",
  "You're no longer an admin of {target}. {requester} has been told to ask someone else.": "你已不是 {target} 的管理員。已通知 {requester} 改向其他人申請。",
  "You're no longer an owner or admin of {target}, so it wasn't connected.": "你已不再是 {target} 的擁有者或管理員，因此沒有連結它。",
  "You're no longer in this channel": "你已不在這個頻道中",
  "You're the owner": "你是擁有者",
  "You've been signed out on every device.": "你已在所有裝置登出。",
  "You've connected a computer to {host}. Disconnect it there first, then connect your server.": "你已將一台電腦連接到 {host}。請先在那邊中斷它的連線，再連結你的伺服器。",
  "You've joined <server></server>.": "你已加入 <server></server>。",
  "You": "你",
  "Your 5-hour reset was used instead of the {kind}: this account has only Claude's older once-a-week 5-hour reset.": "用掉的是 5 小時重設，而不是{kind}：這個帳號只有 Claude 舊版的每週一次 5 小時重設。",
  "Your AppSumo license is being verified. Stripe purchases are unavailable until its status is confirmed. If this persists, contact support.": "正在驗證你的 AppSumo 授權。確認狀態之前，無法透過 Stripe 購買。如果這個狀況持續，請聯絡支援團隊。",
  "Your access to this channel just changed. Refresh and try again.": "你在這個頻道的權限剛剛變了。重新整理後再試。",
  "Your account is scheduled for deletion. Cancel the deletion to keep using Raft.": "你的帳號已安排刪除。撤銷刪除即可繼續使用 Raft。",
  "Your account may not have access to RaftBench on this server.": "你的帳號可能沒有這個伺服器上 RaftBench 的存取權限。",
  "Your account signs in without a password. Sign out and sign in again, then turn on two-step verification within 10 minutes.": "你的帳號登入時不使用密碼。請登出後重新登入，並在 10 分鐘內開啟兩步驟驗證。",
  "Your account will be deleted on {date}": "你的帳號將在 {date} 刪除",
  "Your account will be deleted": "你的帳號將被刪除",
  "Your agent stays where it is now, and Raft cleans up on both computers. Keep {source} and {target} online until it finishes.": "你的 Agent 會留在目前所在的電腦上，Raft 會清理兩台電腦上的殘留。在完成之前，請讓 {source} 和 {target} 保持上線。",
  "Your agent will stop while it migrates, then start again on the new computer.": "遷移期間 Agent 會停止執行，完成後會在新電腦上重新啟動。",
  "Your agents and files stay where they are.": "你的 Agent 和檔案都會保留在原處。",
  "Your agents keep working after you leave.": "離開後，你的 Agent 仍會繼續工作。",
  "Your agents": "你的 Agent",
  "Your browser blocked the new tab": "你的瀏覽器封鎖了新分頁",
  "Your browser won't show it inside this page.": "你的瀏覽器無法在此頁面內顯示它。",
  "Your changes haven't been saved. Discard them?": "你的變更尚未儲存，要捨棄嗎？",
  "Your computer shows up here on its own. No need to refresh.": "你的電腦會自動出現在這裡，不需要重新整理。",
  "Your computers' and agents' keys stop working right away; on the deletion date your computers are deleted.": "電腦和 Agent 的金鑰立即失效；刪除生效時電腦自動刪除。",
  "Your draft is kept. After signing in, submit again when ready.": "草稿已保留。重新登入後，準備好就可以再次送出。",
  "Your drafts changed while this was being sent, so nothing was sent. They're up to date now: check them and send again.": "傳送時你的草稿有變動，所以沒有傳送任何內容。草稿已更新：確認後再傳送一次。",
  "Your drafts": "你的草稿",
  "Your email has been verified. You can now use Raft.": "你的電子郵件已完成驗證，現在可以開始使用 Raft 了。",
  "Your feedback becomes a private ticket for the Raft team.": "你的意見回饋會成為 Raft 團隊內部處理的私人案件。",
  "Your feedback was sent to the Raft team.": "你的意見回饋已傳送給 Raft 團隊。",
  "Your feedback": "你的意見回饋",
  "Your first agent. She helps you onboard, sets up the server, and brings your team in.": "你的第一個 Agent。她會帶你快速上手、設定伺服器，並邀請你的團隊加入。",
  "Your free server already hosts #{name}, a Joint Channel another server has joined. Upgrade to Pro to host more, or wait until all other servers leave #{name}.": "你的免費版伺服器已發起聯合頻道 #{name}，且已有其他伺服器加入。升級到 Pro 即可發起更多，或等 #{name} 中的其他伺服器全部離開。",
  "Your free server already hosts a Joint Channel another server has joined. Upgrade to Pro to host more, or wait until all other servers leave it.": "你的免費版伺服器已發起 1 個有其他伺服器加入的聯合頻道。升級到 Pro 即可發起更多，或等其中的其他伺服器全部離開。",
  "Your lifetime license is managed through AppSumo. Contact support for changes involving an existing paid subscription.": "你的終身授權透過 AppSumo 管理。如需進行涉及現有付費訂閱的變更，請聯絡支援團隊。",
  "Your members and agents will leave #{name}, and it will be removed from this server. The other servers keep the channel and its history.": "你的成員和 Agent 將離開 #{name}，這個頻道也會從此伺服器移除。其他伺服器會保留這個頻道及其歷史記錄。",
  "Your membership in {channel} changed while this was open. Check the servers and connect again.": "這個對話框開啟期間，你在 {channel} 的成員身分有所變動。請檢查伺服器，然後再連結一次。",
  "Your new server {target} was created.": "你的新伺服器 {target} 已建立。",
  "Your old backup codes stop working right away, and your other browsers are signed out. Computers and the raft CLI stay connected. You'll get 10 new ones to save.": "舊的備用碼會立即失效，你在其他瀏覽器上的登入也會被登出。電腦和 raft CLI 會保持連線。你會取得 10 組新的備用碼，請妥善保存。",
  "Your own computer": "你自己的電腦",
  "Your password has been updated. You can now sign in.": "你的密碼已更新，現在可以登入了。",
  "Your personal assistant is archived": "你的個人助理會被封存",
