  "{agent} asked to sign in to an app that isn't installed on this Server.": "{agent} 要求登入一個此伺服器尚未安裝的應用程式。",
  "{agent} asked to sign in to {client}, which isn't installed on this Server. Installing it approves all of the following for this Server: the permissions {client} declared when this request was prepared.": "{agent} 要求登入 {client}，但此伺服器尚未安裝這個應用程式。安裝即代表為此伺服器核准以下所有權限，也就是準備這個要求時 {client} 宣告的權限。",
  "{agent} can't reply right now. Check the balance and billing for the model service this agent uses, then start it again.": "{agent} 暫時無法回覆。請檢查這個 Agent 所用模型服務的餘額和計費狀態，處理好後再啟動。",
  "{agent} stops using GitHub as {account}. The connection stays available to other agents on this server, but only its creator or a server admin can assign it to {agent} again.": "{agent} 將不再以 {account} 的身分使用 GitHub。這個連結仍可供此伺服器上的其他 Agent 使用，但只有它的建立者或伺服器管理員可以再把它指派給 {agent}。",
  "{agent} stops using GitHub as {account}. The connection stays available to other agents on this server, but only {creator}, who created it, or a server admin can assign it to {agent} again.": "{agent} 將不再以 {account} 的身分使用 GitHub。這個連結仍可供此伺服器上的其他 Agent 使用，但只有它的建立者 {creator} 或伺服器管理員可以再把它指派給 {agent}。",
  "{agent} will no longer be able to search or read other agents' context.": "{agent} 將無法再搜尋或讀取其他 Agent 的上下文。",
  "{agent} works on repos, issues and pull requests as the GitHub account you choose.": "{agent} 會以所選的 GitHub 帳號存取儲存庫、Issue 和 PR。",
  "{agent}'s access was already revoked.": "{agent} 的存取權已經撤銷了。",
  "{allowed} · {declined}": "{allowed} · {declined}",
  "{amount} a month": "每月 {amount}",
  "{amount} a year": "每年 {amount}",
  "{appName} is requesting access it has not been granted: {scopes}. Ask the app owner to add these scopes to the OAuth client before trying again.": "{appName} 要求了尚未獲得授權的存取權限：{scopes}。請先聯絡應用程式擁有者，將這些權限範圍加入 OAuth 用戶端後再試一次。",
  "{appName} loses access right away. To use it again, sign in with Raft again.": "{appName} 會立即失去存取權。若要再次使用，請重新透過 Raft 登入。",
  "{appName} requested OAuth scopes Raft does not support: {scopes}. Update the app's requested scopes before trying again.": "{appName} 要求了 Raft 不支援的 OAuth 權限範圍：{scopes}。請先更新應用程式要求的權限範圍，再試一次。",
  "{appName} requested scopes that are unsupported or not granted to this OAuth client: {scopes}. Update the app request or client permissions before trying again.": "{appName} 要求的權限範圍中，有 Raft 不支援或此 OAuth 用戶端尚未獲得授權的項目：{scopes}。請先更新應用程式的要求或用戶端權限，再試一次。",
  "{appName} revoked": "已撤銷 {appName}",
  "{approver} won't be able to approve it. You can ask again later.": "{approver} 將無法再核准這項申請。你之後可以再次申請。",
  "{app} can post as @{handle}. It hasn’t joined {server} yet.": "{app} 可以用 @{handle} 的身分發訊息，還沒加入 {server}。",
  "{app} can’t show link previews on this server.": "{app} 無法在這個伺服器上顯示連結預覽。",
  "{app} has no connections yet.": "{app} 還沒有任何連線。",
  "{app} link previews stop for you on this server, and {app} no longer learns which of its links you view. Signing in to {app} later won’t turn them back on; you can allow them again here anytime.": "撤銷後，這個伺服器上將不再為你顯示 {app} 的連結預覽，{app} 也不會再得知你看過它的哪些連結。之後即使登入 {app} 也不會自動重新開啟；你隨時可以在這裡再次允許。",
  "{app} links stay as they are. You can change this in Settings.": "{app} 的連結會維持原樣。你可以在「設定」中變更。",
  "{app} shows what this link is once you connect your account there.": "在 {app} 連結帳號後，這裡會顯示這個連結的內容。",
  "{app} · {domain}": "{app} · {domain}",
  "{by} handed it back to {name} · {time}": "{by} 交回給了 {name} · {time}",
