  "{channel} already has as many free servers as it can take. Upgrade {target} to Pro to connect it.": "{channel} 中的免費版伺服器已達上限。將 {target} 升級到 Pro 即可連結。",
  "{channel} becomes a channel shared with other servers, and the servers you connect see its earlier messages.": "{channel} 會變成與其他伺服器共享的頻道，你連結的伺服器會看到它先前的訊息。",
  "{channel} can't take any more servers.": "{channel} 無法再連結更多伺服器。",
  "{channel} has guests, so another server can't connect to it yet.": "{channel} 中有訪客，因此其他伺服器目前還無法連結到它。",
  "{channel} has guests, so this server can't disconnect from it. Remove the guests first, or archive the channel.": "{channel} 中有訪客，這個伺服器無法中斷與它的連結。請先移除訪客，或封存這個頻道。",
  "{channel} has too many guests for another server to connect. An external channel holds up to {max} servers and guests together. Ask {inviter} to remove some guests, then open this link again.": "{channel} 的訪客太多，無法再連結其他伺服器。外部頻道的伺服器和訪客合計最多 {max} 個。請 {inviter} 移除部分訪客後，再重新開啟這個連結。",
  "{channel} has too many guests for another server to connect. An external channel holds up to {max} servers and guests together. Remove some guests, then try again.": "{channel} 的訪客太多，無法再連結其他伺服器。外部頻道的伺服器和訪客合計最多 {max} 個。請先移除部分訪客，再試一次。",
  "{channel} has too many guests for another server to connect. An external channel holds up to {max} servers and guests together. Someone in {host} needs to remove some guests first.": "{channel} 的訪客太多，無法再連結其他伺服器。外部頻道的伺服器和訪客合計最多 {max} 個。需要 {host} 的成員先移除部分訪客。",
  "{channel} is being updated. Try again in a minute.": "{channel} 正在更新，請過一分鐘再試。",
  "{channel} is full. Ask {inviter} to free a slot, then open this link again.": "{channel} 已滿。請 {inviter} 騰出名額後，再重新開啟這個連結。",
  "{channel} is ready": "{channel} 已準備就緒",
  "{channel} is shared with other servers, so it can't take guests yet. Connect a server to join it.": "{channel} 已與其他伺服器共享，目前還無法接受訪客。請連結一個伺服器來加入。",
